OL,3,GNEWSAMan in house siege arrested over
OL,4,Aalleged bomb hoax
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who had barricaded himself in a
OL,7,Fhouse he was being evicted from has
OL,8,Fbeen arrested, ending a 27-hour
OL,9,Fstand-off.
OL,11,FNorfolk Police said he was being held
OL,12,Fon suspicion of communicating false
OL,13,Finformation in relation to an alleged
OL,14,Fbomb hoax.
OL,16,FOfficers had been at property on Coast
OL,17,FRoad, Hopton-on-Sea, near Great
OL,18,FYarmouth, since 11:30 GMT on Wednesday
OL,19,Fafter the man, who is in his 40s,
OL,20,Fallegedly made threats when attempts
OL,21,Fwere made to remove him.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
