OL,3,GNEWSAMan in house siege arrested over
OL,4,Aalleged bomb hoax
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was arrested at about 14:00 on
OL,7,FThursday after speaking to Sheila
OL,8,FOxtoby, chief executive of Great
OL,9,FYarmouth Borough Council, who said:
OL,10,F"I'm really pleased to say that the
OL,11,Fincident has come to an end and
OL,12,Fnobody's hurt."
